# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day31

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| delay | 지연시키다 / 지연 | The flight was delayed. |
| issue | 문제 / 발행하다 | We need to solve this issue. |
| resolve | 해결하다 | The manager resolved the problem. |
| ensure | 보장하다 | Please ensure that all doors are locked. |
| inform | 알리다 | Please inform us of any changes. |

